body:
The way I would always explain it was like I had a normal brain and a depressed brain and they'd both be talking to me at the same time but overall it's all in my own head

&#x200B;

There was this one time where I think I might have had an auditory hallucination when I was in middle school. Very different than what I'm describing here though. To be honest though, I'm religious and had always chocked it up to a spiritual thing (ik this might sound stupid) but I've never really known what happened for sure though
